## Development

```bash
uv sync                      # install deps
uv run pre-commit install    # hooks (commit + pre-push)
uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format .
uv run ty check
uv run pylint                # duplicate-code check (R0801)
uv run xenon -b B -m A -a A src tests  # complexity gates (via radon)
uv run radon cc -a -s src tests        # cyclomatic complexity report
uv run radon mi -s src tests           # maintainability index report
uv run pytest
```

Pre-commit runs ruff + hygiene checks; pre-push runs `ty`, `pylint` (duplicate-code), `xenon` (radon complexity), and `pytest`.

